<description>&lt;p&gt;Ukraine deployed naval drones that struck two Russian vessels at Libya's Benghazi port and off its coast, sinking one warship and damaging another, which Ukraine described as self-defence. Libyan forces reported that two of their officers were killed in the Ukrainian attack on the Russian warship. The incident has prompted threats of retaliation from Libyan militias and promises of reprisal from the Libyan army. The conflict still records only two battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/23/ukraine-naval-drones-strike-russian-warship-libya&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/world/middleeast/libya-ukraine-russia-haftar.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOTzIzWjZLTEdiVXRtR0I1cEJ3MFVCUzF5ZktKdWRUQlNtMEVDTnQ4Mk5xU2tvODVlRUJFeE5KOGlieGxsYkp5c1dhZklONzRZNW1VWTR4OVM1MGFQM0cxRXBaQm93b1lhWG1qR3F0ZGV2VTRRRGxtbTRkU1VYQ2c2dEtHckpXQmJCbmpYZlNKeFVrNW8zVjBldDFEWGc1TmIzRTJTM0ozNy1yanVq?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/world/europe/ukraine-libya-russian-ships.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOYjJ5QmRzSmpoZjlaWDd2U2pmYVV5b3RtSFAweXdUQWJVTkRLdU5Ba0hhQno4RUR3MkRYa0xfY3J4OXVhdGJqaEFjRHdBQ0pmeU1CNXFhdDhFT2pDZ1VtQ1dCbmdhZmcwT1YwbmQwVW9lQjJYa25tbndVN000TzlwM09zMjJyUHk2U081b2FMMWJ6LS1vZlltUGt3MVFLOXUxWHE3cWRxZUJPZVp2TlZpRVVWRnQ0Zll3Vmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Breitbart News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOZWpkVk9uNGNkdVlWSFpLdVV2bEpDbWNIdmFCb0VxZXROenJfRkc0d3dMU3FnbFNXbHNaQjAzaHJKWV94bjRncWxEUmVFd